:: Carter Hero Award Part 4 [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 10>>
<span style="Color: Yellow">Despite the attempts to break the tension earlier, the air is still thick with it during the car ride back to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s house. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s dad stares ahead, focusing on driving though seems lost in thought. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> looks annoyed, staring out the window with a grimace.</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>, meanwhile, <span style="Color: LightGreen">is the only one that looks happy, feet swinging back and forth in his seat as he stares down at his award with a smile.</span> Despite his presence being comforting, the car still feel incredibly awkward. You notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> shift in his seat, looking back at <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> through the rearview mirror. Both of your eyes meet for a brief second, causing <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> to quickly try to change the mood, <span style="Color: Yellow">your discomfort clear on your face.</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> asks, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Did you tell your friend about that thing I got you?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh! No, I haven’t yet!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> pops up happily, turning to you with excitement, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“It’s super cool! It’s this- Well, maybe I should wait to show you rather than tell you, that way it’s a surprise! But you’ll love it, I can’t believe he found it! I’ve been trying to find it everywhere, but it wasn’t even online. How did you even find something like that <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>?”</span> <br>
<br>
<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hehe, I have my ways.”</span> He shrugs, smirking proudly, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’re not the only one with award-winning skills.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span>’s efforts work as the mood lifts and the three of you begin to chat and joke around. You try to pry more information about this gift, though all you’ll able to get is that it’s Ultraman related, as expected, and is something rather old you can’t buy in stores anymore. Seems <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> did some rather tough digging to be able to find it second-hand and get it ordered and delivered on time for <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s big day. <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightGreen">It’s clear <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Callum</span> loves <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> very much, the two joking around like best friends. The attitude also helps his father’s expression, which softens into a smile as he listens to you all chat.</span> <span style="Color: Yellow">Still, knowing what you know, there is still an underlining tension that only grows as you approach <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span>’s house.</span> <br>
<br>
